<Document>
  <name>SAMPLE - Agra Development Authority boundary layers</name>
  <description>SAMPLE ONLY - NOT SURVEY DATA. Synthetic rectangles and hexagons placed near Agra to show the layout docs/icms/kml-import-spec.md asks for. Codes, khasra numbers, ULPINs and owner names are invented. An OpenStreetMap Overpass query for Agra ward boundaries (boundary=administrative, admin_level=10) returned nothing on 2026-09-24, so no real outline is used and no ODbL attribution is needed.</description>
